OL,3,GNEWSAThousands raised after ball breaks
OL,4,Astained glass
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at Hull Minster say they have
OL,7,Fbeen overwhelmed with donations after a
OL,8,Fstained-glass window was smashed by a
OL,9,Frugby ball.
OL,11,FThe ball broke part of the church's
OL,12,Fwest window after being kicked about
OL,13,F26ft (8m) into the air in February,
OL,14,Faccording to a witness.
OL,16,FRepairs to the window and others there
OL,17,Fare expected to cost #30,000, but more
OL,18,Fthan #16,000 has already been raised
OL,19,Fthrough a crowdfunding platform.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
