OL,3,GNEWSAThousands raised after ball breaks
OL,4,Astained glass
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Cameron, heritage manager at the
OL,7,Fchurch, said: "We've raised half the
OL,8,Fmoney needed, not just to fix that
OL,9,Fwindow, but to fix all of the stained
OL,10,Fglass and windows in the church, which
OL,11,Fis huge news for us."
